    "attributes": {
        "action": "Legalise Marijuana: Socialisation, Research and prevent waste in Cultivation",
        "additional_details": "To boost Economics.\r\nBreak the social stigmatisation of Marijuana smoking.\r\nCreate 2 types of cafes: Medicinal and Recreational. \r\nAllow Hollistic, Sprititual and Cultured areas. \r\nBring justice and create a 2 way relationship between ciminality and law.\r\nConsented, anonymous, structured sampling oppertunities to heighten Marijuana research.\r\nUse already cultivated Marijuana to meet the supply and demand of Medicinal and Recreational use in a strategic, healthy, guided way. \r\nAllow people to smoke sensibly.",
        "background": "To allow a revolutional process in the legalisation of Marijuana. Have clear narratives with Medicinal and Recreational Marijuana. Opening Medicinal and Recreational social cafes to allow research to reach its full potential. \r\nEducate/regulate responsible use.\r\nCharity oppertunity to reduce tax.",
